,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":82.485446078,"data":"I don't have access to the specific details of your situation. However, here are some general steps you can take to evict your tenant immediately:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":82.486658081,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":82.487899507,"data":"1. Notify the landlord of your intention to evict them. You can do this by sending a written notice to the landlord, or by sending a verbal notice to the tenant.\n"}
