,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":809.394813481,"data":"- Environmentally friendly: Public transit reduces carbon emissions and pollution.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":809.395927303,"data":"- Safe and reliable: Public transit is often safer and more reliable than driving.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":809.397170804,"data":"- Convenience: Public transit is often more convenient than driving, especially for those who live in rural areas or have limited access to public transportation.\n"}
