,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.762144004,"data":"Instruction:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.763357761,"data":"How to make frosting with crisco\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.764536638,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.765691167,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.766883555,"data":"To make frosting with crisco, follow these steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.768093752,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.76936517,"data":"Ingredients:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.770505997,"data":"- 1 cup unsalted butter\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.771670445,"data":"- 1 cup granulated sugar\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.772801954,"data":"- 1 cup heavy cream\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.773954354,"data":"- 1 teaspoon vanilla extract\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.775118179,"data":"- 1/2 teaspoon salt\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.776365049,"data":"- 1/2 cup crisco (or melted butter)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.777460515,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.778618154,"data":"Instructions:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.779683143,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.781006437,"data":"1. Melt the butter in a double boiler or in a saucepan over low heat.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.782257879,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.78354045,"data":"2. Add the sugar and vanilla extract to the melted butter and stir until the sugar has dissolved.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.784529297,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.785475265,"data":"3. Add the salt and stir until the mixture is smooth.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.786470687,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.787463233,"data":"4. Slowly add the cream to the mixture, whisking constantly to prevent lumps from forming.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.78855942,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.789743556,"data":"5. Add the crisco to the mixture and stir until the frosting is smooth and creamy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.790807609,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.79193249,"data":"6. If the frosting is too thick, add a little more cream until it reaches your desired consistency.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.792987405,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.79398888,"data":"7. Once the frosting is smooth and creamy, transfer it to a bowl and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the cream to set.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.795125499,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.796036229,"data":"8. Once the frosting is set, it can be used as a frosting for cakes, cupcakes, or other desserts.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.796932716,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.797935704,"data":"Response B:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.798822715,"data":"Frosting with crisco is a classic and delicious way to add a touch of sweetness to your cupcakes or cookies. Here's a simple recipe for making frosting with crisco:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.799650482,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.800506976,"data":"Ingredients:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.801318813,"data":"- 1 cup unsalted butter, at room temperature\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.802110389,"data":"- 1 cup granulated sugar\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.802918118,"data":"- 1 cup heavy cream\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.80374243,"data":"- 1 cup crisco (or melted butter)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.804542908,"data":"- 1 teaspoon vanilla extract\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.805409753,"data":"- 1/2 teaspoon salt\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.806214931,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.807012113,"data":"Instructions:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.807890408,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.808814553,"data":"1. In a large bowl, cream together the butter and sugar until light and fluffy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.809653118,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.810461868,"data":"2. Add the heavy cream, crisco, vanilla extract, and salt to the bowl and mix until well combined.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.811286063,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.812112109,"data":"3. If the frosting is too thick, add a little more heavy cream until it reaches your desired consistency.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.813342286,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.814265891,"data":"4. Transfer the frosting to a 9-inch square baking dish and smooth out the surface with a spatula.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.815095921,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.815977126,"data":"5. Let the frosting cool for a few minutes before serving.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.816824791,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.817696788,"data":"Enjoy your delicious and creamy frosting with crisco!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1369.818551908,"data":"\n"}
