,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.903448386,"data":"Hi, I have some falafel, but no tahini to put on them. Can you give me a recipe for making tahini?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.904352446,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.90523428,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.906093793,"data":"Sure, here's a recipe for making tahini:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.907171366,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.908352181,"data":"Ingredients:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.909209239,"data":"- 1 cup of ground chickpeas\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.910054436,"data":"- 1/2 cup of water\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.9109451,"data":"- 1/4 cup of lemon juice\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.911785124,"data":"- 1/4 cup of olive oil\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.912926733,"data":"- 1/4 cup of honey\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.913851491,"data":"- 1/4 cup of ground cumin\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.914758149,"data":"- 1/4 cup of ground coriander\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.915713921,"data":"- 1/4 cup of ground cinnamon\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.916863229,"data":"- 1/4 cup of ground ginger\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.918090739,"data":"- 1/4 cup of salt\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.919178653,"data":"- 1/4 cup of water\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.920414956,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.921558309,"data":"Instructions:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.922791661,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.923962678,"data":"1. In a large mixing bowl, combine the chickpeas, water, lemon juice, olive oil, honey, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, ginger, salt, and water.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.925105219,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.926317874,"data":"2. Mix well until the mixture is smooth and well combined.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.927523741,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.928775546,"data":"3. Transfer the mixture to a food processor or blender and blend until it becomes a smooth paste.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.930406441,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.931703809,"data":"4. Taste the tahini and adjust the seasoning as needed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.932685663,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.933589756,"data":"5. Transfer the tahini to a jar or container and store it in the refrigerator until ready to use.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.934477309,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.935472271,"data":"Enjoy your delicious homemade tahini!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1377.936354502,"data":"\n"}
