,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.515703569,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.516769924,"data":"The cost of fuel for a 14 mile journey in a car with 48mpg, fuel costs 625 pence per gallon. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.517840004,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.518921207,"data":"If there is heavy traffic for half the journey, the fuel cost will increase. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.520061559,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.521118289,"data":"To calculate the increased fuel cost, we need to know the distance traveled during the heavy traffic period. Let's assume the distance traveled during the heavy traffic period is 10 miles. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.522165605,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.523167419,"data":"The increased fuel cost will be 625 pence per gallon multiplied by the distance traveled during the heavy traffic period, which is 10 miles. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.524260598,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.525312545,"data":"Therefore, the increased fuel cost will be 625 pence per gallon multiplied by 10 miles, which is 6250 pence. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.526392604,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.527490386,"data":"So, the increased fuel cost for the 14 mile journey with heavy traffic will be 6250 pence. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.528543095,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.529601636,"data":"In conclusion, the increased fuel cost for the 14 mile journey with heavy traffic will be 6250 pence.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.530621436,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.531569814,"data":"Response B:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.532455362,"data":"To calculate the cost of fuel for the 14 mile journey in a car with 48mpg, fuel costs 625 pence per gallon, and there is heavy traffic for half the journey, we need to follow these steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.533299621,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.534125122,"data":"1. Calculate the total distance traveled: 14 miles\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.535008934,"data":"2. Calculate the total fuel consumed: 14 miles / 48 mpg = 0.2917 gallons\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.535867067,"data":"3. Calculate the fuel cost: 0.2917 gallons * 625 pence per gallon = 195.93 pence\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.536737998,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1388.537550729,"data":"Therefore, the cost of fuel for the 14 mile journey in a car with 48mpg, fuel costs 625 pence per gallon, and there is heavy traffic for half the journey is 195.93 pence.\n"}
