,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1400.624459897,"data":"There are several reasons why someone might prefer to shop at a small, locally-owned business instead of a large chain store, even if the prices are higher:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1400.625550807,"data":"\n"}
