,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1423.671730091,"data":"1. Practice Mindfulness: Mindfulness is a technique that helps you to be present in the moment and observe your thoughts and emotions without judgment. It can help you to reduce stress and anxiety by helping you to stay focused and calm.\n"}
