,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.489270056,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.490463116,"data":"HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) is a markup language used to create web pages. It defines the structure and content of web pages, including the layout, formatting, and content. JavaScript (JavaScript Language) is a programming language used to create dynamic web pages. It allows web developers to add interactivity and functionality to web pages, such as animations, forms, and user interactions.\n"}
