,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.495318477,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.496321173,"data":"HTML is a markup language used to structure and organize content on a web page. It defines the structure and content of the page, including headings, paragraphs, images, tables, and other elements. HTML is a markup language, which means that it is a set of rules that define the structure and content of the page.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.497122186,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.498009704,"data":"JavaScript, on the other hand, is a programming language used to create dynamic web applications. It is a scripting language that allows developers to add interactivity and functionality to web pages. JavaScript is used to create dynamic content, such as dynamic forms, dynamic content, and dynamic animations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1530.498838123,"data":"\n"}
