,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1647.153955522,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1647.154732276,"data":"6. Application layer: This layer is responsible for providing end-to-end communication between applications. The application layer protocol is TCP (Transmission Control Protocol) and UDP (User Datagram Protocol).\n"}
