,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.662713087,"data":"I can provide you with a general guide on how to install window blinds. Here are the steps you need to follow:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.663551009,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.664354856,"data":"1. Choose the right blinds: before installing the blinds, you need to choose the right ones. Look for blinds that fit your window and are compatible with your home's climate and weather conditions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.665136808,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.665996458,"data":"2. Gather the necessary materials: you will need a set of window blinds, a saw, a drill, a screwdriver, and a level.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.666818535,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.667668234,"data":"3. Cut the blinds: use a saw to cut the blinds to the desired length. Make sure to cut them to the correct size, taking into account the height of the window and the width of the blinds.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.668483683,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.669327295,"data":"4. Install the blinds: use a drill to screw the blinds into the window frame. Make sure to use a level to ensure that the blinds are straight.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.670117423,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.670927235,"data":"5. Test the blinds: once the blinds are installed, test them to make sure they are securely fastened. If they are not, adjust the screws or the blinds to ensure they are secure.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.671770933,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1707.672636091,"data":"6. Clean the blinds: after installing the blinds, clean them thoroughly to remove any dust or debris.\n"}
