,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.649918055,"data":"Kickball is a team sport played on a rectangular court with a net at each end. The ball is a small, round ball that is made of rubber or plastic. The ball is thrown by one player, and the other player tries to catch it with their hands or feet. The ball must be thrown at least 10 feet away from the net and at an angle of 45 degrees to the ground.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65075299,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.651635532,"data":"The game is played in sets of 12, with each team having 6 players. The first player to score 6 points wins the game. The score is determined by the number of points scored by each team. The team with the most points at the end of the game wins.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65246135,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.653252382,"data":"To avoid taking advantage of you, here are some tips for playing kickball:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65404189,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65493685,"data":"1. Keep your hands and feet close to the ball, and avoid throwing it too hard or too quickly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65578499,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.65658099,"data":"2. Focus on catching the ball, not trying to throw it back to your teammates.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.657379284,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.658161208,"data":"3. Use your hands to catch the ball, rather than your feet.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.658999143,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.659844342,"data":"4. Keep your eyes on the ball, and avoid looking at your teammates.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1724.660686153,"data":"\n"}
