,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.864357647,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.865237989,"data":"Carbon fibers are used in buildings in various ways, including:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.866195055,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.867088292,"data":"1. Structural support: Carbon fibers are used to create lightweight and strong structural supports for buildings, such as columns, beams, and walls. They are also used to reinforce concrete and other materials, making them more durable and resistant to damage.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.867973683,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.868961492,"data":"2. Thermal insulation: Carbon fibers are used to create thermal insulation for buildings, which helps to reduce heat loss and gain. They are also used to create thermal bridges, which help to regulate the temperature inside buildings.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.869880923,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.870888394,"data":"3. Sound insulation: Carbon fibers are used to create sound insulation for buildings, which helps to reduce noise pollution and improve the quality of life for residents.\n"}
