,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.874055187,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.87512403,"data":"5. Energy storage: Carbon fibers are used to create energy storage systems for buildings, such as batteries and capacitors. They are also used to create energy-efficient lighting systems.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1815.876052973,"data":"\n"}
