,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.656151107,"data":"Instruction:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.657039924,"data":"One or more jobs can be run automatically by a workflow. The workflows are defined in the repository as YAML files and will run if an event occurs in the repository, as well as manually, or on a certain schedule.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.658360194,"data":"Bring an example of a workflow that demonstrate the CI/CD features of GitHub Actions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.658905577,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.659815587,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.660855902,"data":"Sure, here's an example workflow that demonstrates the CI/CD features of GitHub Actions:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.661775518,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.662682757,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.663563628,"data":"name: CI/CD\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.664450761,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.665290537,"data":"on:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.666252163,"data":"  push:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.667263597,"data":"    branches: [main]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.668333355,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.669409871,"data":"jobs:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.670328385,"data":"  build:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.671257673,"data":"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.672062227,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.673040362,"data":"    steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.674086492,"data":"      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.67496182,"data":"      - name: Set up Node.js\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.67584861,"data":"        uses: actions/setup-node@v2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.676823375,"data":"        with:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.677771095,"data":"          node-version: 14\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.678681603,"data":"      - name: Install dependencies\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.679595892,"data":"        run: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.680491748,"data":"          npm install\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.681342196,"data":"      - name: Build and deploy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.682196523,"data":"        run: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.683047643,"data":"          npm run build\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.683902161,"data":"          npm run deploy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.684929608,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.685826703,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.686699275,"data":"This workflow has the following features:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.687570023,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.688535895,"data":"1. `on`: This specifies the events that trigger the workflow, in this case, `push` events that occur when a new branch is created.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.689465188,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.690375332,"data":"2. `jobs`: This defines the workflow's jobs, which are the steps that will be executed when the workflow is triggered.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.691167263,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.691985401,"data":"3. `build`: This step sets up the environment by running a `checkout` action to get the repository's code. It then installs the necessary dependencies using a `setup-node` action.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.692955759,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.693887065,"data":"4. `install dependencies`: This step installs the necessary dependencies using a `install` action.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.694802031,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.695727661,"data":"5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.696664152,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.697561857,"data":"Response B:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.69847431,"data":"Here is an example workflow that demonstrates the CI/CD features of GitHub Actions:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.699326937,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.700253813,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.70107109,"data":"name: Build and Deploy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.701981465,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.702856693,"data":"on:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.703896425,"data":"  push:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.704849683,"data":"    branches:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.70575451,"data":"      - main\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.70669538,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.707556165,"data":"jobs:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.708378025,"data":"  build:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.709159285,"data":"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.710022635,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.710851074,"data":"    steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.711675072,"data":"      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.712477723,"data":"      - name: Set up Node.js\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.713289124,"data":"        run: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.714080895,"data":"          curl -sL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_14.x | bash -\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.714855278,"data":"          apt-get update\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.715654231,"data":"          apt-get install -y nodejs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.716447418,"data":"      - name: Install dependencies\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.717207038,"data":"        run: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.718037908,"data":"          npm install\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.718887472,"data":"      - name: Build and deploy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.719730257,"data":"        run: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.720504695,"data":"          npm run build\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.721296321,"data":"          npm run deploy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.722052613,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.722935991,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.723796283,"data":"In this workflow, we have a single job called \"build\" that runs on every push to the repository. The \"runs-on\" field specifies the operating system and architecture that the job should run on.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.724564158,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.725347137,"data":"The \"steps\" section of the job defines the steps that will be executed. In this case, we have three steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.726186563,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.727021842,"data":"- The first step uses the \"actions/checkout@v2\" action to checkout the repository.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.727914867,"data":"- The second step sets up Node.js by running a curl command to download the Node.js installer and install it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1835.728778277,"data":"\n"}
