,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1892.603118119,"data":"3. Use descriptive language: use descriptive language to bring your story to life. This will help readers visualize the events and emotions.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1892.604140576,"data":"\n"}
