,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1892.607240346,"data":"5. Use storytelling techniques: use storytelling techniques to make your story more engaging. This will help readers connect with you and understand your perspective.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1892.608328962,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1892.6093155,"data":"6. End with a call to action: end your memoir with a call to action. This will encourage readers to take action and make a difference in their lives.\n"}
