,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.20017184,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.201436032,"data":"To initialize a Typescript project using npm and git, follow these steps:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.202617077,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.203832732,"data":"1. Open your terminal or command prompt and navigate to the directory where you want to create your project.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.205011238,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.206205697,"data":"2. Run the following command to initialize a new TypeScript project:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.207417366,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.208660648,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.209754001,"data":"npm init\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.210947908,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.212130102,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.213350215,"data":"This command will create a new `package.json` file in the current directory, which contains information about your project, including the name, version, and dependencies.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.214475883,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.215706933,"data":"3. Run the following command to initialize a new TypeScript project with git:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.216933323,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.21814949,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.21937608,"data":"npm init -g\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.220543131,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.221764014,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.222933215,"data":"This command will create a new `package.json` file in the current directory, which contains information about your project, including the name, version, and dependencies. You can then use git to manage your project by committing and pushing changes to the repository.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1898.224203226,"data":"\n"}
