,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.674938612,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.675859501,"data":"In terms of current-day inventions, some of the most significant ones include the internet, the smartphone, and the mobile phone. These inventions have made it possible for people to communicate with each other and access information and entertainment on a global scale. The internet has also made it possible for people to connect with each other and with businesses, and has made it possible for people to access information and entertainment from anywhere in the\n"}
