,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.679923621,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.680833419,"data":"The current-day inventions back then were vastly different from what we have today. The world was a place of innovation and progress, with the development of new technologies and industries. The world was a place of progress, with the development of transportation, communication, and energy sources.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.681677679,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.682527029,"data":"One of the most significant inventions of the 1950s was the atomic bomb. This weapon was a game-changer, and it had a profound impact on the world. The development of the atomic bomb led to the development of nuclear weapons, which were used in the Second World War and continue to be used today.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1994.683382289,"data":"\n"}
