,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.075784618,"data":"Instruction:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.076654464,"data":"Mick pays his teacher $800 for 40 lessons worth 2 hours each. If this will be all he is going to pay for his lessons, how much did he receive?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.077458913,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.078313611,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.079167991,"data":"To find out how much Mick received, we need to calculate the total cost of the lessons and then subtract the amount he paid for them.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.080042933,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.080793702,"data":"The total cost of the lessons is 40 lessons x 2 hours each = 80 hours.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.081645608,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.082563423,"data":"Since Mick paid $800 for 80 hours of lessons, we can calculate the amount he received by subtracting the cost from the total hours:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.083282608,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.084019071,"data":"$800 - $800 = $0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.084882895,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.085748561,"data":"Therefore, Mick received $0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.086548688,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.087295505,"data":"Response B:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.088019841,"data":"To find out how much Mick received for his 40 lessons, we need to calculate the total cost of the lessons and then subtract the cost of the lessons he already paid for.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.088914254,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.089746368,"data":"The cost of the lessons is $800 per lesson, and he is paying for 40 lessons. So, the total cost of the lessons is:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.090472901,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.091213061,"data":"$800/lesson * 40 lessons = $32,000\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.092066193,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.092878399,"data":"Since he is only paying for 40 lessons, the cost of the lessons he already paid for is $32,000.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.093688363,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.094460131,"data":"Therefore, the amount he received for his 40 lessons is:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.095168895,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.095998987,"data":"$32,000 (total cost of lessons) - $800 (cost of lessons already paid for) = $31,200\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.096819021,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.097614246,"data":"Mick received $31,200 for his 40 lessons.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2018.098385523,"data":"\n"}
