,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2020.27181003,"data":"1. Grilled Chicken and Vegetable Skewers: Preheat the grill to medium-high heat. Season the chicken breasts with salt and pepper, and grill for 8-10 minutes per side until cooked through. Assemble skewers with sliced vegetables such as zucchini, bell peppers, and onions, and serve with a side of roasted sweet potato fries.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2020.272984594,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2020.274249073,"data":"2. Baked Salmon with Roasted Vegetables: Preheat the oven to 400°F. Season the salmon fillets with salt and pepper, and brush with olive oil. Place the fillets on a baking sheet and bake for 10-12 minutes until cooked through. Assemble roasted vegetables such as asparagus, broccoli, and carrots, and serve with a side of roasted sweet potato fries.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2020.275436377,"data":"\n"}
