,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2123.763629157,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2123.764763221,"data":"To determine how much Navina and her younger sister each have to spend, we need to know the weekly budget of each sister. Let's assume Navina's weekly budget is $B and her younger sister's weekly budget is $A. According to the problem, Navina has $30 more than her younger sister, so we can write the equation:\n"}
