,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2123.785080768,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2123.785982046,"data":"Assuming Navina has $30 more than her younger sister, let's say her younger sister has $x. Then Navina has $x + $30. \n"}
