,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2141.506056846,"data":"Inconsistency is a fundamental aspect of ideological thinking, which refers to the tendency of individuals to hold different beliefs or opinions about the same issue or topic. This can lead to a lack of coherence and consistency in one's thinking, which can result in a lack of clarity and understanding of the issues at hand.\n"}
