,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.55899887,"data":"I don't have the capability to build a pc. However, I can provide you with some general information on how to build a pc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.560126205,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.561048444,"data":"building a pc is a complex process that requires a lot of knowledge and skill. Here are some general steps you can follow to build a pc:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.561928297,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.562998179,"data":"1. Choose the right hardware: the first step is to choose the right hardware for your pc. You need to consider the processor, graphics card, RAM, storage, and other components that will be used in your pc.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.564078426,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.565101399,"data":"2. Choose the right operating system: the operating system is the foundation of your pc. You need to choose the right operating system that suits your needs and preferences. Popular operating systems include windows, mac os, and linux.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.566064068,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.566983657,"data":"3. Choose the right software: the software you use to run your pc is essential. You need to choose the right software that suits your needs and preferences. Popular software includes windows, mac os, and linux.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.567836467,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.568939037,"data":"4. Choose the right components: the components you choose to assemble your pc are crucial. You need to choose the right components that fit your hardware and operating system. Popular components include processors, graphics cards, RAM, storage, and other components.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.569998559,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.571000291,"data":"5. Choose the right tools: the tools you use to assemble your pc are essential\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2369.572084554,"data":"\n"}
