,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.867489204,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.868415301,"data":"To generate an automatic table of contents in a LaTeX document, you can use the `tocloft` package. Here's an example of how to use it:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.869190718,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.870023981,"data":"```latex\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.870870194,"data":"\\documentclass{article}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.87175146,"data":"\\usepackage{tocloft}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.872570719,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.873341548,"data":"\\begin{document}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.874158301,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.875042736,"data":"\\tableofcontents\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.875888331,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.876724309,"data":"\\chapter{Introduction}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.877585969,"data":"\\section{Section 1}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.878391695,"data":"\\label{sec:sec1}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.879245969,"data":"This is the first section of the table of contents.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.880044831,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.881144285,"data":"\\section{Section 2}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.882091709,"data":"\\label{sec:sec2}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.883003364,"data":"This is the second section of the table of contents.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.883878176,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.884730762,"data":"\\section{Section 3}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.885544696,"data":"\\label{sec:sec3}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.886421968,"data":"This is the third section of the table of contents.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.887268536,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.888076632,"data":"\\end{document}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.888912629,"data":"```\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.889782,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2448.890650605,"data":"In this example, we first include the `tocloft` package. Then, we use the `\\tableofcontents` command to generate the table of contents. We then use the `\\chapter` and `\\section` commands to create the individual sections of the table of contents. Each section is numbered using the `\\label` command, which is defined in the `tocloft` package. Finally, we use the `\\end{document}` command to close the table of contents.\n"}
