,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.348726922,"data":"In this math problem, we are asked to figure out the percentage of total profits that are made in each quarter. They are 90% in the first quarter, 92% in the second quarter, 81% in the third quarter and 88% in the fourth quarter. What is the total profit percent over a period of time, based upon these quarters?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.349633787,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.350645714,"data":"Response A:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.35165173,"data":"To find the total profit percent over a period of time, we need to add up the profits from each quarter and then divide by the total profit. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.352694843,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.353777706,"data":"First quarter: 90% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.3548886,"data":"Second quarter: 92% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.356024709,"data":"Third quarter: 81% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.356931049,"data":"Fourth quarter: 88% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.357971977,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.358909299,"data":"Total profit for the period = 90% + 92% + 81% + 88% = 351%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.359979789,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.361080776,"data":"Total profit percent = (Total profit for the period / Total profit) * 100%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.362099285,"data":"Total profit percent = (351% / 351%) * 100% = 100%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.363081992,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.363949223,"data":"Therefore, the total profit percent over the period of time is 100%.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.364908303,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.365967539,"data":"Response B:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.366969487,"data":"To find the total profit percent over a period of time, we need to add up the profits from each quarter and then divide by the total profit. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.368091002,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.369179722,"data":"First quarter: 90% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.3702499,"data":"Second quarter: 92% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.371486977,"data":"Third quarter: 81% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.372591047,"data":"Fourth quarter: 88% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.373467678,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.374294988,"data":"Total profit from each quarter: \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.375076945,"data":"90% of total profit + 92% of total profit + 81% of total profit + 88% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.375846133,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.376755683,"data":"Total profit from each quarter: \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.377584087,"data":"(90 + 92 + 81 + 88) / 4 = 351 / 4 = 87.75%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.378367498,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.379118183,"data":"Total profit from all quarters: \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.379948447,"data":"87.75% of total profit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.380796771,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.381590686,"data":"Total profit percent over a period of time: \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.38233177,"data":"(87.75% of total profit) / (total profit) * 100% = 87.75% / 100% * 100% = 87.75%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.383032205,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.383862836,"data":"Therefore, the total profit percent over a period of time is 87.75%.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2478.385026008,"data":"\n"}
